WEBVTT

00:09:59.469 --> 00:10:03.238
♪ Are there stars in hell ♪ 
(Apakah ada bintang di neraka)

00:10:03.238 --> 00:10:06.917
♪ And I'd like to know ♪ 
(Dan aku ingin tahu)

00:10:06.917 --> 00:10:10.721
♪ know if you can tell ♪ 
(apakah kamu tahu)

00:10:10.721 --> 00:10:14.161
♪ that you make me lose ♪
(bahwa kamu membuatku)

00:10:14.161 --> 00:10:17.846
♪ everything I know ♪
(kehilangan semuanya)

00:10:17.846 --> 00:10:21.447
♪ That I cannot choose ♪
(dan aku tidak bisa memutuskan)

00:10:21.454 --> 00:10:25.597
♪ to or not let go ♪
(untuk melepaskan atau tidak)